            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Display Toggle 1.07

## Changes

- The display list in the menu no longer shows each display's resolution.
  Each row now shows the display type and, for the main display, "Main display".

Requires macOS 13 Ventura or later. A purchase includes updates through Display
Toggle 2.x.
]]></description>
